# Virtue of Strength: each copy of the replacement applies once to the same mana (CR 614.5, 616.1), so two of them make a basic land
# produce nine times as much. Turn 1 Bot1 casts one with Black Lotus and four Moxen; turn 3 it plays a Forest, taps it ({G}{G}{G}, one
# Virtue) and with that {G}{G}{G} and the four Moxen pays for a second. Turn 5 a second Forest taps for {G} x9.

